<title>FRANCE: ATHLETICS-RUSSIA SET RELAY RECORD.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-RUSSIA SET RELAY RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia broke the world women's indoor 4x400 metres relay record on Sunday when they clocked three minutes 26.84 seconds at the world indoor championships.</p>
<p>The previous mark of 3:27.22 was set by Germany in Seville, Spain, on March 10, 1991.</p>
